Package: fcrci
Type: Package
Title: FDR-Consistent Confidence Intervals for Multiple Comparisons
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Joaquín", "Armendano", , "armendano.joaquin@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Computes confidence intervals that are consistent with
    false discovery rate (FDR) adjusted p-values, using the false coverage-statement
    rate (FCR) adjustment of Benjamini and Yekutieli (2005)
    <doi:10.1198/016214504000001907>. When p-values are adjusted with the
    Benjamini-Hochberg or Benjamini-Yekutieli procedures, the intervals exclude
    the null value exactly for the hypotheses that are rejected, so intervals and
    adjusted p-values agree by construction. The first release supports
    contrasts produced by the 'emmeans' package.
